	(descr "INGHAi GSPK1506025TN-8R0.5W-1 speaker, 15x6x2.5 mm, 8 ohm 0.5 W (LCSC C46961944). Spring contacts, not solder terminals: the speaker is pressed onto these pads by the enclosure (contacts stick out 0.9 mm below the body). Pads from the datasheet pad area (drawing FS-1506R8P-01): 2.0 x 1.5 mm, 12.6 mm between inner edges, 1.2 mm off the centre line. No paste: bare ENIG gold for the contacts. Front (sound outlet) faces away from the PCB.")
